# Barkskin and Frenzied Regeneration are not in this priority: they wait for low health, and the game hides your health from addons in combat. Use them by hand.

# Generated by `make wowsims-packs` (tools/wowsims/apl.lua) from tools/wowsims/specs/druid_guardian.lua: edit that recipe, not this file.
# Setting maintain_demoralizing_roar (maintenance debuff: demoralizing_roar), default off in game, on in the harness.
# Movement: default #2 reaches default: elunes_light, optional_on_use_items, enrage, faerie_fire, demoralizing_roar, primal_bite, lacerate, maul
# Omitted: precombat #2: itemSwap
# Omitted: precombat #3: itemSwap
# Omitted: default #2: move
# Omitted: default #3: waitUntil
# Omitted: default #4: item 9449
# Omitted: default #5: currentHealthPercent: the player's health, hidden in combat
# Omitted: default #7: item 10646
# Omitted: default #8: other OtherActionDefensivePotion
# Omitted: default #9: other OtherActionOffensivePotion
# Omitted: default #10: selectedConjured
# Omitted: default #12: currentHealthPercent: the player's health, hidden in combat
# Omitted: default #14: itemSwap
# Omitted: optional_on_use_items #1: hidden
# Omitted: optional_on_use_items #2: hidden
# Omitted: optional_on_use_items #3: hidden
